 R←Test_SendEmail_30(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log
⍝ Send emails to a lot of CCs
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←⎕NEW SMTP.MailParameters
 parms.To←∆CONNECTION.ConnectionParms.Userid
 ⍝ We take advantage of the fact that Google ignores everything from the + onwards to the "@", and many others followed
 parms.CC←⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/5{⍺←1 ⋄ (a b)←'@'(≠⊆⊢)⍵ ⋄ (a∘{⍺,'+',⍕⍵}¨⍳⍺),¨⊂'@',b}∆TO
 ⍝ It will send only a single message, but all return codes will be checked internally
 parms.Subject←'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 parms.Body←'Test mail'
 (rc msg log)←∆CONNECTION.Send parms
 Assert 0=rc

 :If ∆ConfirmEmailOkay''
     R←T._OK
 :EndIf
⍝Done
